<title>UK: Berlin Hannover Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hannover Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN HANNOVERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY  **13.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    13.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    BER/HAN   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 13.AUG.97 THEN STEPS UP TO 4.8 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
